        "question": "Does Perry need Node.js or a runtime?",
        "answer": "Native Perry binaries run without Node.js, Bun, Deno, or an external JavaScript engine installed. They do include the Perry runtime and garbage collector, statically linked. Packages that need engine semantics can use the optional embedded V8 fallback."
      },
      {
        "question": "How big are the compiled binaries?",
